<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights--USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 51,800 MT were primarily the result of increases for unknown destinations (24,000 MT) and China (22,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 2,000 MT were to Jamaica (1,300 MT) and the United Arab Emirates (800 MT).</p>
</text>
